<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">Esther</book>
  <para style="h">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc1">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esther</para>
  <para style="mt">Esther</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahasueras damlai in hichi a honghi a, hiai Ahasueras bel India a kipan Ethiopia tan a, bial za leh sawmnih leh sagih tung a vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huailai a, Inpi Susan a kumpipa Ahasueras a gam mangtutphah tung a a tutlai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A vaihawm kum thum kum in, a vaihawmte leh a sikhate tengteng ading in Ankuangluina a bawl a; Persia leh Media thuneihna, bialte a miliante leh vaihawmte a ma ah a om uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A gam thupi hauhsaknate leh a vaihawmna sang zahtakhuaina ni tampi, ni za leh sawmgiat a ensak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in hiai nite zoh in, kumpipa’n Inpi Susan a om mite tengteng, a lian leh a neu, adin kumpipa Inpi pisa ah, Ankuangluina ni sagih a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puan kang khaite, a hing, a dum, puanmalngat hoih leh sandup khauzangte a dangka zungbuhte leh suangpak khuamte a henden a om a: tutna nemte dangkaeng leh dangka a bawl, suangchian suangpak san, ngou, eng leh vom a bawl tung ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dangkaeng noute in dawn ding amau a pia ua, noute a kibang kei vek uhi, kumpipa uain tampi, kumpipa khuttawi letna dungzui zel in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in dan bangzel in uain dawnna a om a; kuamah phutluih a omkei hi: kumpipa’n a inn heutu tengteng kiang ah, michih in nuam a sak bangzel ua a hih ding un a theisak khin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpinu Vasti in leng kumpipa Ahasueras in a om numeite ading in Ankuangluina a bawlsam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni sagih ni a, kumpipa lungtang uain a kipak a a omlai in, Mehuman, Biztha, Harbona, Bigtha leh Abagtha, Zether, leh Karkaste, kumpipa Ahasueras omna a nasem michilgehte thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa ma a kumpi lukhu toh Vasti hon tonpih a, a kilawmna mite leh vaihawmte ensak ding in, amah et in a hoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh kumpinu Vasti in michilgehte zang a kumpipa thupiak hoh lou ding in a sel a: huaiziak in kumpipa a heh mahmah a, asung ah a hehna a kuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchihlai in hunte thei mipilte kiang ah kumpipa’n, huchibang lah kuapeuh dan leh vaihawmna theite lau a kumpipa omdan sek ahi him hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah zom in Karsena, Sethar, Admatha, Tarsis, Meres, Marsena leh Memukan, Persia leh Media vaihawmtu sagihte kumpipa mai mute leh, gamsung a tumasate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Michilgehte zang a kumpipa Ahasueras chih a hihlouh ziak in, dan dungzui in kumpinu Vasti tung ah bang i hih ding ua?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa leh vaihawmte ma ah Memukan in a dawng a, “Kumpinu Vasti kumpipa tung ah kia thil diklou hih ahi kei a, kumpipa Ahasueras bial sung a om vaihawmte tengteng tung leh mite tengteng tung ah leng hih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahasueras in a ma a hongpai ding in kumpinu Vasti thu a pia, himahleh a hongpai kei, chih a kigenthang chiang in, hiai kumpinu thilhih numei tengteng kiang a tung ding a, a mit uah a pasalte uh simmohna suaksak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuni a kumpinu thilhih naza Persia leh Media vaihawmte’n kumpipa vaihawmte tengteng kiang ah huchi mah bang a gen ding uh. Huchi in nakpi a kisimmohna leh thangpaihna a hong kipankhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa deihlam ahihleh, amah a kipan kumpi thupiak pekhia henla, Vasti kumpipa Ahasueras ma ah hongpai nawn hetlou ding chih, hihlamdan theihlouh ding in, Persia mite leh Media mite dante lak a gelh in om hen; huan kumpipa’n amah sang a hoihzaw midang khat amah kumpi mun leh mual pe leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n thupiak a bawl ding a gamsung tengteng a a kithehzak chiang in, a thupi ngal a; zi tengteng in a pasalte uh, a liante leh a neute kiang ah zahtakna a pe ding uh” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in thugen in kumpipa leh lalte a kipaksak a; huchi in Memukan thu dungzui in kumpipa’n a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman lah huai a kigelh dungzui in, kumpipa bial tengteng, bial chiteng leh mi chiteng kiang ah a pau uh dungzui in, huchi a michih in amah inn sung mahmah a dante a puaklut theih a, a mite pau dungzui a, a thehzak theihna ding in laikhakte a khakta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai thilte zoh in, kumpipa Ahasueras thangpaihna lungkimsak a om in, Vasti bang ahia a hih, a siatna dia bang ahia thupiak chih a theigige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in a nasepsak kumpipa sikhate’n a kiang ah, “Kumpipa ading in nungak siangthou tuailai melhoih kizong henla:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a gam a bial tengteng ah heutu sep hen, huaite’n nungak siangthou tuailai tengteng Susan Inpi ah, numeite inn ah, Hegai kumpipa michilgeh numeite kempa in a hon pikhawm theihna ding un; huchi in siansakna ding a thilte uh amau kipe leh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in nungak kumpipa lungkimsak pen Vasti sik in kumpinu hi hen” a chi uhi. Huai thil in kumpipa a lungkimsak a; huchibang in a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Susan Inpi ah Judah mi kuahiam, a min Mordekai, Jair tapa, Shimei tapa, Benjamin mi a om a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah bel Jerusalem a kipan a salte Judah kumpipa Jekoniah Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in a pimang a omte toh pimang in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman Hadassah, huai bel Esther, a pangak tanu a kem piching hi: aman nu leh pa a neikei a, huai nungak a kilawm in a melhoih hi: a nu leh pa a sih un, Mordekai in a tanu ding in a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in hichi a honghi a, kumpipa thupiak leh a thubawl a kizak in, nungak tampi Susan Inpi, Hegai in a kaihkhawm a omlai un, Esther leng kumpipa in ah, Hegai, numeite kempa nuai ah a honpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in nungak in amah a lungkimsak a, amah siamna a ngahta a; aman siansakna ding in a thilte amah a pepah a, a tantuante toh, amah piak ding a kilawm, kumpipa in a kipan nungak sagih toh: amah leh a nungakte numeite in a mun hoihpen ah a suanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Esther in a hihna a genkhe kei a, a tanaute hihna leng a genkhe sam kei hi: Mordekai in lah genkhe lou ding in amah a thuhilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Mordekai bel niteng in numeite inn mai ah a Esther in bangchi’n a hihzel a, bang a hong chidia chih thei ding in a hohzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Numeite adia dan dungzui a kha sawmlehnih, murra thau toh kha guk, gim namtuite toh kha guk leh, numeite siansakna ding a t hilte toh, huchibang in a siansakna nite hihkim a a om nung in, nungak chih kumpipa Ahasueras kiang a a valut hun uh a tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nungakte kumpipa kiang a a lut chiang un, kumpipa inn a hohpih ding in numeite omna a kipan a deihdeih uh piak in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nitaklam in a pai a, a zingnawn in numeite inn nihna ah, kumpipa michilgeh Shasgaz, meite kempa inn ah a hongkik a: kumpipa amah ah kipak napi in, kumpipa kiang ah a honglut kei a, a min a sap in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi a amah a tanu ding a la pa, Mordekai pangak Abihail tanu, Esther kumpipa kiang a a valut hun a hongtun in, Hegai kumpipa michilgeh, numeite kempa a seh chih ngallouh bangmah a kankei hi. Huchi in amah ente tengteng mitmuh in Esther in deihsakna a ngah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in Esther kumpipa Ahasueras kiang a kumpi inn ah a kha sawmna, Tebeth kha a vaihawm kum sagihna kum in laklut in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n numei tengteng sang in Esther a it a, nungak siangthoute sang in a mitmuh in hehpihna leh deihsakna a mu hi; huchi in a lu tung ah lallukhu a koih a, Vasti sik in kumpinu ding in amah a bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchihlai in kumpipa’n a vaihawmte tengteng leh a sikhate tengteng ading in Ankuang thupi, “Esther Ankuang mahmah” a luita a: bialte kiang ah khawlna a bawl a, kumpipa siamna bangzel in, thilpiakte a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi a nungak siangthoute nihveina dia kaihkhawm a omlai un, Mordekai bel kumpipa kongpi ah a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Esther in a tanaute leh a mite hihna a genkhe kei; amah kiang a khanletsak a om bangtak in Mordekai thupiak bang in a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huailai a, Mordekai kumpipa kongpi a a tutlai in, kumpipa michilgeh lak a nih, Bigthan leh Teresh, kongkhak ngakte a heh ua, kumpipa Ahasueras tung a khutkha ding in a zongta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai thil Mordekai in a thei a, aman kumpinu kiang ah a theisak hi; Esther in Mordekai min in huai a kumpipa a hilhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in a thu a kikan leh, huchibang ahi ngei chih a ki mukhia a, a nih un sing dawn ah khailup in a om ua: tanchin gelhna laibu ah kumpipa ma ah a kigelhta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai thilte nung in kumpipa Ahasueras in Haman Agagmi Hammedatha tapa a kaisangsak a, malam a nawtsak a, a kiang a om vaihawmte tengteng tunglam ah a tutphah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa sikha tengteng, kumpipa kongpi a omte niamchik in a kun ua, Haman a zahtak mahmah uh: kumpipa’n amah tungtang thu huchibang in thu a pia hi. Himahleh Mordekai a kunkei a, amah zahna a bawlkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchihlai in kumpipa sikhate, kumpipa kongpi a omte’n, Mordekai kiang ah, “Bangding a kumpipa thupiak a talek na hia?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, ni teng a amah a houpih lai un, amau a ngaikhe kei a, Mordekai thu paiding hia pailou ding chih thei ding in Haman a hilh uh: amah Judah mi ahi chih amaute a hilhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi a Mordekai niamchik a kunlou in, amah a zahtak kei chih Haman in a theih in, a heh mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh Mordekai tung kia a khutkhak bang thamlou in a ngaihtuah a; Mordekai mite lah amah a ensakta ngal ua; huchi in Haman in Ahasueras gam pumpi a om Judahte tengteng, Mordekai mite, hihgawp ding in a zongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahasueras vaihawm kum sawmlehnih ni, kha khatna, Nisan kha in, “Pur” a san ua, huai bel aisan ahi, Haman ma ah, niteng in, kha teng in, kha sawmlehnih, Adar kha tan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan Haman in kumpipa Ahasueras kiang ah, “Mi kuate hiam kithehzak a na gam bial sung tengteng a mite lak a dalh a om ua; a Dante uh mi tengteng Dan toh a kibang kei a; kumpipa dante a zuikei uhi: huaiziak in amaute thuakzoh kumpipa punna ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa deihlam ahihleh, hihgawp a a omna ding un lai kigelh leh: kumpipa nasepna a heutute khut ah ken dangka talent sang sawm ka pe ding, kumpipa sumbawmte a tawilut ding in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in a khut a kipan kumpipa’n a zungbuh a suah a, Agagmi Hammedatha tapa Haman kiang ah, Judahte melmapa kiang ah a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n Haman kiang ah, Dangka na kiang a piak ahi, mipi leng, amau tung a pha na saksak hih ding in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchihlai in a kha khatna, a ni sawmlehthum ni’n, kumpipa laigelhmite a samlut ua, kumpipa heutuliante leh kumpipa bial chih a omte tengteng leh mi chiteng vaihawmte Haman in thu a piak peuhmah dungzui in a kigelhta hi; bialchih kiang ah huai a kigelh dungzui in, michih kiang ah a pau bangzel un; kumpipa Ahasueras min in a kigelh a, kumpipa zungbuh in suai a kisawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in, Adar kha, kha sawmlehnih, a ni sawmlehthum ni mahmah a, ni khat a, Judah mite tengteng a tek a khang naupang noute leh numeite hihgawp ding, that ding leh mangthangsak ding in, kumpipa bial sung tengteng ah dak in laikhakte a khak ua, a sum uh gallak a la sak ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Laigelh kopi, thupiak bialteng a piakkhiak ding leh huai ni dia mansa a om chiat ding a, mi tengteng kiang ah a suah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa thupiak in dakte kinohtak in a sawlkhia ua, Susan Inpi ah thupiak a kipekhia hi: huchi in kumpipa leh Haman dawn ding in a tu ua; himahleh Susan khopi a lungzing hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi a kihih tengteng Mordekai in a theih in, a puante a botkek a, vut toh saiip puan a silh a, khopi laizang ah a paikhia a, ngaihtak leh nakpi’n a kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa kongpi mai pha in a hongpai a: saiip puansilh mi kuamah lah kumpipa kongpi sung ah a lut theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in bial chiteng a, koilai peuh a kumpipa thupiak leh a thubawl tunna ah, Judahte lak ah nakpitak a sunna, anngawlna, kahna, mauna a om hi; mi tampi saiip puansilh in, vut lak ah a lum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Esther nungakte leh a heutute a hongpai ua a thu amah a hilhta uhi; huchi in kumpinu a dah mahmah a: puansilh Mordekai silh ding in a khak a, amah a kipan a a saiip puan lakhe ding in: himahleh a sangkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Esther in Hatak, kumpipa michilgehte lak a khat a sam a, amah vil ding a kumpipa’n a seh, Mordekai kiang a hohding in thu a pia hi, hiai bang thu ahi, bangdia hichi ahi chih thei ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchibang in Hatak bel kumpipa kongpi mai a om, khopi mun za ah Mordekai kiang ah a va pawtkhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mordekai in a tung a tung tengteng thu amah a hilh a, Judahte adia, amaute hihsiatna ding, kumpipa sumbawmte a Haman in dangka sumpiak ding a a chiam zah geih a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huailou leng Esther kiang a lak ding leh, a kiang a phuan ding in amaute hihsiatna ding a Susan a thubawl piakkhiak laigelh kopi amah a pia a; kumpipa kiang a vahoh ding a hilh din, a kiang a thumna vabawl ding leh a mite adia, a ma a ngetna vabawl ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Hatak a hong a Mordekai thute Esther a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchihlai in Esther in Hatak kiang ah thu a gen a, Mordekai ading thukhah a pia hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kumpipa sikhate tengteng leh, kumpipa bialte a mite’n a thei kilkel uhi, mi kuapeuh numei, pasal leng, saplouh a, kumpipa pisa sungnung zaw pen a a hoh uleh, amah ading in dan khat a om a, ‘sihsak ding’ chih leh, ‘a hing ding,’ chi a, kumpipa’n dangkaeng kumpi chiang a letkhumte chih louh ngal: himahleh hiai ni sawmthum kumpipa kiang a hongpai ding in sap in ka na omta kei hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan Esther thute Mordekai a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchihlai in Mordekai in Esther kiang a dawnna vatun nawn ding in amau a chi a, “Judah tengteng sang in, kumpipa inn sung a nang na suahtak kingaihtuah het ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang hiai hun a bangmah genlou a na daih dide leh, mun dang a kipan in Judahte ding in panpihna leh hutkhiakna a hongom ding a, himahleh nang leh na pa inkawte na mangthang ding uh: hun hichibang adia honglal na hihmel kuan a thei a?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Esther in Mordekai kiang a dawnna vatun ding in amau a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kuan inla, Susan a om Judahte tengteng kaikhawm inla kei ding in anngawl unla, ni thum, zan hiam sun hiam: nek lah ne kei unla, dawn leng dawn kei un: huchi mah bang in ken leng ka nungakte toh an ka ngawl ding uh; huaichiangin kumpipa kiang ah ka hoh ngeingei ding, dan bang zaw ahi kei a: huchi a ka man leh, mang ka himai ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Mordekai a kuan a, Esther in amah thu a piak tengteng bang in a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hichi ahi a ni thum ni’n, Esther in a kumpi puansilh a silh a, kumpipa inn zawn a, kumpipa pisa sungnung zaw pen ah a vading a: kumpipa bel inn lutna zawn a, kumpi inn ah a mangtutphah tung ah a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichibang ahi a, kumpipa’n pisa a kumpinu Esther ding a muh in, a mitmuh in deihsakna a ngahta hi: kumpipa’n a khut a om dangkaeng kumpi chiang Esther lam ah a lik hi. Huchi in Esther a hongnai a, kumpi chiang dawn a khoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Bang na deih a, kumpinu Esther? Na ngetna bang ahia? Gam kimkhat tan leng piak na hi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Esther in, “ kumpipa’n hoih a sakleh tuni’n kumpipa leh Haman amah adia ka bawl annekna ah hongpai un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan kumpipa’n, “Haman kinoh sak un, Esther gen bang a hih a hih theihna ding in” a chi hi. Huchi in Esther annekna bawl ah kumpipa leh Haman a hong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan uain a dawnlai un kumpipa’n Esther kiang ah, “Bang ahia na thumna? Phal a hihtheihna ding in: bang ahia na ngetna? Gam kimkhat tan in leng piak ahi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Esther in a dawng a, “Ka thumna leh ka ngetna hiai ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa mitmuh a deihsakna ka muh leh, ka thumna phal ding, leh ka ngetna bawl ding a kumpipa a lungkim leh, kumpipa leh Haman amau adia ka bawl ding annekna ah hong le uh, kumpipa’n a chih bang in zingchiang in ka hih ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in huai ni’n nuamsa leh lung kipak in Haman a paikheta a: himahleh Mordekai kumpipa kongpi a om, amah dia ding lou a tat leng tanglou Haman in a muh in, Mordekai tung ah a heh mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in leng Haman a ki ip teitei a, inn ah a paita; huan mi a sawl a a lawmte leh a zi Zeresh a hon tonpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Haman in a kiang uah, a hauhsakna thupina leh, a tate tamdan leh, kumpipa’n a kaisang sakna thil tengteng leh kumpipa sikhate vaihawmte tung a a masak tuamdan a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Haman in, ahi, “Esther in annekna a bawl ah mi kuamah kumpipa toh kei chih louhngal a hohsak kei; zingchiang in leng kumpipa toh kei a honsam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hitamahleh Mordekai huai Judapa, kumpipa kongpi a tu ka muh laiteng hiaite tengteng kei ading in bangmah a phatuam kei,” a chilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in a zi Zeresh leh a lawmte’n a kiang ah, “Khailupna khuam tong sawmnga a sang kibawl henla, zingsang in nang kumpipa kiang ah thugen inla huai a Mordekai khailup ahihtheih na ding in; huchi in vualnuamtak in kumpipa toh annekna ah na hoh ding uh” a chi uhi. Hiai in Haman a kipaksak a; huchi in khailupna khuam a bawlsakta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai zan in kumpipa a ihmu theikei; tanchin chiamtehna laibu hontawi ding in thu a pia a, huaite kumpipa ma ah a sim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa michilgehte lak a mi nih Bigthan leh Teresh, kongkhak vengte’n, kumpipa Ahasueras tung a khutkhak sawmte tanchin Mordekai in a gen chih a kigelh muh in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n, “Hiai ziak in Mordekai tung ah bang zahtakna leh thupina hih in a om a?” a chi hi. Kumpipa sikha amah nasemte’n, “Amah a ding in bangmah hih a omkei” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “Pisa a om kua ahia?” a chi a. Huchi in Haman kumpipa inn pisa pawnung zaw ah, kumpipa kiang a a bawlkholhsa khailupna khuam a Mordekai khai ding gen ding in a honghi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa sikhate’n a kiang ah, “Ngai in pisa ah Haman a ding nilouh hi” a chi ua. Kumpipa’n, “Honglut heh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Haman a honglut hi. Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Mi kumpipa’n a zahtaknop tung ah bang kihih ding ahia?” a chi hi. Haman in a lungtang in, Kumpipa’n kei sang a zahtak kua kiang a bawl nuamzaw ahia? a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Haman in kumpipa kiang ah, “Kumpipa’n a zahtak nopmi ading in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a silhzel kumpi puansilh hon lakhia henla, sakol kumpipa tuanzelna leng, a lu zang a lallukhu a koihna zel:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in puansilh leh sakol kumpipa vaihawmpih thupi penpente lak a khat khut ah pekhe leh, huaite a kumpipa’n zahtak a utpa a zep theihna ding un leh, khopi kongzing lak ah sakol tung ah tuangsak henla, a ma ah, huchibang in kumpipa’n a zahtak nopte kiang ah hih in a om ding, chi in phuang leng” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huailai tak in kumpipa’n Haman kiang ah, “Kin inla, na chih bang in, puansilh leh sakol la inla, kumpipa kongpi a tuzel Mordekai Judah mi tung ah hih in: na gen tengteng bangmah vuaksuak kei hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Haman in puansilh leh sakol a la a, Mordekai a zem a, khopi kongzing lak ah a tuangsak a, a ma ah, “Hichibang in kumpipa’n a zahtak nop mi tung a a hih ahi ding” chi in, a phuangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan Mordekai kumpipa kongpi ah a hongpai nawn a. Himahleh Haman bel sun leh a lutang khuhsa in a inn lam ah kintak in a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Haman in a zi Zeresh kiang leh a lawmte tengteng kiang ah a tung a thiltung tengteng a genvek hi. Huaitak in a mipilte leh a zi Zeresh in a kiang ah,“A ma a na puk patna Mordekai Judah chi a mi a hileh, amah na zoukei ding, himahleh a ma ah na puk ngei ding” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah toh a houlim sanlai un, kumpipa michilgehte a hongpai ua, Esther in annek ding a bawlna ading in kintak in hongpita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa leh Haman kumpinu Esther toh annekna ah a hong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Uain a dawnlai un a ni nihni in kumpipa’n Esther kiang ah, Bang ahia na thumna, kumpinu Esther? A hon phalsak ding uh: bang ahia na ngetna? Gam kimkhat leng piak in na om ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in Esther kumpinu’n a dawng a, “Aw kumpipa, na mitmuh a deihsakna ka muh a, kumpipa kipahna ahihleh, ka thumna ah ka hinna leh ka mite hinna piak in om hen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zuak in ka omta ua, kei leh ka mite, hihgawp a om ding in, thah a om ding in leh hihmang ding in. Sikhapa ding leh sikhanu ding a zuak a om hi le ung zaw, melma in kumpipa siatna gunbawl theita kei mahleh, daidide ding hi veng in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahasueras in thu a gen a, kumpinu Esther kiang ah, “Kua ahia, kaw om ahia, huchibang a lungtang sung a tum ngam?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Esther in, “Melma leh gal, hiai giloupa Haman mah” a chi hi. Huchi in kumpipa leh kumpinu ma ah Haman a lauta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in uain annekna a kipan a heh ziak in kumpipa ading a Inpi huan sung ah a lu a: huchi in kumpinu Esther kiang a a hinna ngen ding in Haman a dingta hi; kumpipa’n a siatna ding in hoihlou a tup a om chih a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa Inpi huan a kipan uain annekna mun ah a hongkik a; huchi in Esther omna tutphah nem tung ah Haman a puk hi. Kumpipa’n, “Inn sung a ka ma a kumpinu nangawn sual ding ahi hia?” a chi hi. Kumpipa kam a thupawt bang in, Haman maitang a tuamsakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huailai in kumpipa ma a om zel michilgehte lak a khat, Harbonah in, “En un, Haman in Mordekai, kumpipa gum a thugenpa adia a bawl, khailupna khuam tong sawmnga a sang, Haman inn ah ading hi” a chi hi. Huan kumpipa’n “Huai ah amah khailum un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Mordekai adia a bawlkholh sak khailupna khuamtung ah Haman a khailumta uhi. Huchi in kumpipa thangpaihna a daita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai ni’n kumpipa Ahasueras in Judahte melmapa Haman inn kumpinu Esther kiang ah a pia hi. Kumpipa ma ah Mordekai a hong a; Esther in amah ading in kua ahia chih a genkhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n a zungbuh a suah a, Haman a kipan a lak, Mordekai kiang ah a peta hi. Esther in Haman inkaw tung ah Mordekai a koihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Esther in kumpipa ma ah thu a genlai a, a khebul a puk in, Agagmi Haman gilou bawl leh Judahte siatna ding a a lunggel khitsa a lunggelna koihmang ding in khitui toh amah a ngen ngutngut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n Esther lam ah a dangkaeng kumpi chiang a len a. Huchi in Esther a thou a kumpipa ma ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman, “Kumpipa lungkimna a hih a, a mitmuh deihsakna ka muh a, kumpipa ma a thildik a a lat a, a muh a lungkimhuai ka hihleh, Haman Hammedatha Agag mi tapa in laikhak a bawlte kumpipa bial a om Judahte hihsiatna ding a a gelh sut in om hen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchilou in ka mite tung a gilou tungding ken bangchi’n ka en ngam dia? Ahihkeileh ka tanaute siatna bangchi in ka mu ngam dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahasueras in kumpinu Esther kiang leh Mordekai Judah mi kiang ah, “Ngai un, Judahte tung a a khut a khak ziak in, Haman inkawte leh, khailupna khuam a a khailuppa uh amah Esther kiang ah a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na deih bang in, kumpipa min in, kumpipa zungbuh a sawn in, Judahte kiang ah leng laigelh un: laigelh kumpipa min a gelh a, kumpipa zungbuh a sawn, mi kuapeuh in a hihlamdang thei ngal kei a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa laigelhmite a sam ua, a kha thumna Sivan kha a, a ni sawmnih leh thum ni’n; Judahte tungtang thu Mordekai in thu a piak bang in gam heutute kiang leh, India a kipan Ethiopia pha a om bialte ukpipate leh vaihawmte, bial za leh sawmnih leh sagih, huai a gelhdan bangzel a bial chiteng kiang, mi chiteng a pau uh dungzui zel in, a laigelh uh bangzel a Judahte, a pau uh bangzel in a kiang uah gelh in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahasueras min in a gelh a, kumpipa zungbuh in a sawn a, kumpipa nasepna a kizangsek sakol man gang, hoihtak a vulhte a tuang in sakol tung ah dak in laikhakte a khakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ah kumpipa’n khopi chiteng a om Judahte kikhawm khawm a, a hinna ua dia pang a, amaute sual ding a nauneute uleh a numeite uh, a sum uh gallak a la ding a kisa mite leh bial thilhihtheihna hihse ding leh mangthang sak din phalna a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahasueras bial tengteng ah ni khat in, huaibel, a kha sawmlehnih, Adar kha ahi a, a ni sawmlehthumni tak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bial chiteng a piak ding chi a thupiak, kigelh a kopi mite tengteng kiang ah suah in a om a, huai ni chiang a Judahte’n a melmate uh tung a phula ding a mansa a omchiat theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in dak kumpipa nasepna a zat sakol mangangte tung a tuangte a paikhia ua, kumpipa thupiak in amau a nawh in a khawksak ngal ua; thupiak pen Susan Inpi a piakkhiak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Mordekai bel kumpi puandum leh kang, dangkaeng lallukhu thupi toh, puanaktual puanmalngat hoih leh sandup toh kumpipa ma a kipan a paikheta hi: Susan khopi a kikou a, a kipak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in Judahte’n kouzanna leh kipahna, nuamna leh zahna a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bial chiteng leh, khopi chiteng a, koilai peuh a kumpipa thupiak leh a thubawl paina peuh ah, Judahte’n Ankuangluina leh ni hoih kipahna leh nuamna a nei uhi. Huchi in gam a mite lak a tampite Judahte a honghi ua; Judahte launa lah a tung uah a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan a kha sawmlehnih, Adar kha, huai mah a ni sawmlehthum ni, kumpipa thupiak leh a thubawl tangtunna ding a hong nailai in, Judate melmate’n a tung ua vaihawmna neih a kilamet ni uh; hinapi a, a hilou lam a hong kilehbuta, Judate’n amau mudahte tung a vaihawmna a hon neihlai un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahasueras bial tengteng a khopite uah Judahte, amau siatna zongte tung a khutkha ding in, a kikhawm khawm ua: kuamah in lah amaute a nangzou kei uhi; mite tengteng tung ah lah amaute launa a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in bialte a vaihawmte leh, gamukmite leh, ukpipate leh kumpipa nasemte’n, Judahte a panpih ua; Mordekai launa lah a tung uah a hongom ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa inn ah Mordekai a thupi a, bial tengteng ah a min a thang kheta hi: hiai mipa Mordekai lah a hong thupi semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in namsau a sat in Judahte’n a melmate tengteng a that ua, thahna leh hihsiatna in, amaute mudahte tung ah a hih ding uh a hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Susan Inpi ah Judahte’n mi za nga a that ua a hihgawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Parsandatha, Dalphon, Aspahtha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Poratha, Adalia, Aridatha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Parmastha, Arisai, Aridai, Vajezathate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judate melmapa Hammedatha tapa Haman tapate, a that ua; himahleh gallak ah a khut uh a nga kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ni’n Susan Inpi a thah a om zah kumpipa ma ah a hontawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan kumpipa’n kumpinu Esther kiang ah, “Judate’n Susan Inpi sung ah mi za nga a that ua a hihsia uh, Haman tapa sawmte toh; kumpipa bial dangte ah bang a chi bawlta phet ding uam ah: Khaile, bang na thum a? Na kiang a phal ahi ding: ahihkeileh bang ahia na ngetlai? Na kiang a phal ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Esther in, Kumpipa lungkimna ahihleh, zingchiang a tuni a thupiak bangbang a gamtang ding in Susan a om Judahte phal inla, Haman tapa sawmte khailupna khuam ah kikhai le uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in huchibang a hih ding chi’n kumpipa’n thu a pia hi: Susan ah thubawl a kipekhia a: huchi in Haman tapa sawmte a khaita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Adar kha mah a ni sawmlehli ni’n Susan a om Judahte a kikhawm khawm ua, Susan ah mi za thum a that uh; himahleh gallak tung ah a khut uh a nga kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa bialte a om Judah dangte a kikhawm khawm ua, a hinna uh a hum ua, a melmate ua kipan khawlna a nei ua, amau mudahte lak ah mi sing sagih leh sang nga a that ua; himahleh gallak tung ah a khut uh a nga kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Adar kha ni sawm leh thumni in hiai tuh hih ahi; huai mah a ni sawmlehli ni’n a khawl ua, Ankuanglui ni leh kipahna ni’n a zang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh Susan a om Judate a kikhawm ua a ni sawmlehthum ni’n, leh a ni sawmlehli ni’n; huai mah a ni sawmlehnga ni’n a khawlta ua, Ankuanglui ni leh kipahna ni’n a zang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaiziak in khoneute a Judahte, khaw kulhbang neilou a tengte’n, Adar kha ni sawmlehli ni kipahna ni leh Ankuanglui nin, ni hoih ni, leh a kuakua tantuan kikhakna ni’n a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan Mordekai in hiai thilte a gelh a, kumpipa Ahasueras bial tengteng a om Judahte, gamla leh nai a omte kiang ah a khak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kum teng a, Adar kha ni sawmlehli leh ni sawmlehnga ni kumteng a tang ding a hilhna ding in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judahte a melmate ua kipan a khawlni uh, amau adia lungkhamna kipahna a hong hihna kha, misi sunna ni hoih a hong hihna kha bang in: huai nite Ankuangluina leh kipahna ni a om ua, tantuante a kuakua a kikhak ua, gentheite kiang ah thilpiakte piakna a neih theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in Judahte’n a patkhitsa bang un leh, Mordekai in amaute kiang a a gelhkhitsa bang in hih ding in a theisiam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hammedatha tapa Haman, Agagmi, Judah tengteng melmapa’n Judah tengteng siatna ding amau hihse ding, a ngaihtuah a, amaute hihgawp ding leh, amaute hihse ding a, Pur, huai bel, aisan ahi, a na paih ziak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh a thu kumpipa ma a hongtun in, a ngaihtuah gilou, Judahte siatna dia a ngaihtuah, amah lutung mahmah a kibung ding in laikhakte in thu a peta a; huchi a amah leh a tapate khailupna khuam a khai a omna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchibang a hih ziak in hiai nite Purim, Pur minzui in a sa uhi. Huaiziak in hiai laikhak thute tengteng ziak leh hiai thu tungtang thu a muhsa uh, a tung ua hongtun ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judahte’n a hihkip ua, amau tung leh, a suante uh tung leh, amaute huchibang a kizomkhawm bangte tengteng tung ah a kisuanta uhi, huchi a pellou a, huai a laigelh dungzui leh, huai a hun sehsa dungzui a, kum chiteng a hiai ni nihte a tan theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi a hiai nite a khang a khang a, a inkuan kuan a, bial chiteng leh khopi chiteng a theihgige leh tan a omtheihna ding in; huchi a hiai Purim nite Judahte lak a kipan a a zuaulouh a, huaite theihgigena leng a suante uh a kipan a manlouhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in kumpinu Esther, Abihail tanu leh, Mordekai Judah min, hiai Purim laikhak nihna sukkipna ding in thuneihna tengteng in a gelhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Judahte tengteng kiang ah, Ahasueras gam a bial za leh sawmnih leh sagihte kiang ah, lungmuanna leh thutak thute, laikhakte a khakta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hiai Purim nite a hun a sehsa uh, Mordekai Judah mi leh kumpinu Esther in huaite pha a sak uh dungzui leh, amau ading leh a suante uh adia, anngawlna leh a kahna thu ua a na hihkip bang ua hihkip ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Esther thupiak in hiai Purim thute a hihkip a; laibu ah a kigelhta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan kumpipa Ahasueras in gam tung leh, tuipi tuikulh gam tung ah siah a bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in a thilhihtheihna leh a hatna thilhihte tengteng leh, Mordekai, kumpipa’n amah a koihsangna, letna genna kim, Media leh Persia kumpipate chiamtehna laibu a gelh ahi kei umaw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mordekai Judah mi, kumpipa zom a Judate lak a lian ahi, a u a nau mi tampi in a pom uh ahi. Aman mite hoihna ding zong a nasem a chipihte tengteng kiang a lemna thu a gen hi.
  </para>
</usx>
